{
  "job_B9.2.6_20251003_115001": {
    "chunk_text": "de. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Antonius & Cleopatro h\u00e6fdon gegaderod sciphere on \u00fe\u00e6m Readan S\u00e6. Ac \u00fea him mon s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t Octauianus \u00feiderweard w\u00e6s, \u00fea gecierde eall \u00fe\u00e6t folc to Octauianuse, Hio \u00fea Cleopatra het adelfan hiere byrgenne, & \u00fe\u00e6roninnan eode. \u00dea heo \u00fe\u00e6ron gelegen w\u00e6s, \u00fea het hio niman ipnalis \u00fea n\u00e6dran, & don to hiere earme, \u00fe\u00e6t hio & hio \u00fe\u00e6t for \u00fe\u00e6m dyde \u00fee hio nolde \u00fe\u00e6t hie mon drife beforan \u00fe\u00e6m triumphan wi\u00fe Rome \u00dea Antonius geseah \u00fe\u00e6t hio hie to dea\u00fee gerede, \u00fea ofsticade he hiene selfne, & bebead \u00fe\u00e6t \u00dea Octauianus \u00feider com, \u00fea het he niman o\u00feres cynnes n\u00e6dran, uissillus is haten, sio m\u00e6g Ac hio w\u00e6s gefaren \u00e6r he \u00feider come. Si\u00fe\u00fean Octauianus begeat Alexandriam, Egypta heafedburg, & mid hiere gestreone he \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s VII hunde wintra & XXXV, gewear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00dea w\u00e6s sweotole getacnad, \u00fea he cniht w\u00e6s, & hiene mon wi\u00f0 Rome weard l\u00e6dde \u00e6fter Iuliuses On \u00fe\u00e6m hringe wes getacnad \u00fe\u00e6t on his dagum sceolde weor\u00fean geboren se se \u00fee leohtra is & & se ele getacnade miltsunge eallum moncynne. Swa he eac monig tacen self gedyde \u00fee eft gewurdon, \u00feeh he hie unwitende dyde on Godes Sum w\u00e6s \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6t he bebead ofer ealne",
